uru\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.p,{children:\"The initiative aims to encourage citizens, institutions, organisations, and young people to take an active role in protecting Bengaluru's natural environment. Key objectives include:\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Increasing Bengaluru's urban green cover and urban ecology through large-scale tree plantation.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Encouraging long-term maintenance, ownership, and protection of planted saplings.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Improving public awareness of environmental conservation, biodiversity, and sustainable lifestyles.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Creating healthier public spaces through responsible community and institutional participation.\"}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.hr,{}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h2,{id:\"the-koti-vriksha-mission\",children:\"The Koti Vriksha Mission\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.p,{children:[\"As part of its environmental commitment, Swarna Bharat Foundation undertakes tree-plantation activities under the \",(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Koti Vriksha Mission\"}),\", jointly with BBMP.\"]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.p,{children:[\"The foundation's initiative includes the plantation of \",(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"more than 3 lakh saplings\"}),\", accompanied by robust efforts toward their continued maintenance and care. The emphasis remains firmly on creating trees that survive, grow, and contribute meaningfully to Bengaluru's urban environment.\"]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.hr,{}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h2,{id:\"major-event-activities\",children:\"Major Event Activities\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h3,{id:\"1-tree-plantation--sapling-distribution\",children:\"1. Tree Plantation & Sapling Distribution\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Organised Plantation:\"}),\" Saplings are planted systematically across public spaces, parks, roadside areas, and campuses in coordination with local authorities.\"]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Campaign Distribution:\"}),\" Saplings are provided directly to residents, schools, NGOs, and corporate groups to plant and nurture in their own communities.\"]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h3,{id:\"2-tree-adoption--maintenance\",children:\"2. Tree Adoption & Maintenance\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.p,{children:\"Planting a tree is only the first step. To ensure a high survival rate, the campaign emphasizes:\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Regular watering and removing weeds around growing saplings.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Setting up protective tree guards where appropriate to prevent physical damage.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Constant growth monitoring and replacing failed saplings whenever necessary.\"}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h3,{id:\"3-educational--environmental-awareness-campaigns\",children:\"3. Educational & Environmental Awareness Campaigns\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.p,{children:\"Interactive sessions are hosted across neighbourhoods to educate citizens on critical ecological issues:\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"The long-term impact of urban forests on air pollution and climate change.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Practical strategies for localized waste management and water conservation.\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Protecting native vegetation, pollinators, birds, and insects to preserve healthy soil and water cycles.\"}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h3,{id:\"4-school-college--corporate-participation\",children:\"4. School, College & Corporate Participation\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Youth Engagement:\"}),\" Students act as Green Ambassadors by taking green pledges, entering creative competitions, and driving campus plantation activities.\"]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Corporate CSR:\"}),\" Businesses participate through funding long-term maintenance, sponsoring tree guards, and organizing collective employee volunteering drives.\"]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.hr,{}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h2,{id:\"suggested-event-program\",children:\"Suggested Event Program\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.p,{children:\"The formal execution structure for the Tree Plantation & Environmental Awareness Drive follows this sequence:\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ol,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Welcome, Registration, & Inauguration Ceremony\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Introduction to the Koti Vriksha Mission & Environmental Address\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Tree Plantation Ceremony, Sapling Distribution, & Care Demonstrations\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Collective Green Pledge by Participants\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Environmental Awareness Rally & Community Outreach\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:\"Group Photograph, Documentation, & Vote of Thanks\"}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.hr,{}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h2,{id:\"the-green-pledge\",children:\"The Green Pledge\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.blockquote,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.p,{children:'\"I pledge to protect nature, plant and care for trees, conserve water, reduce waste, respect biodiversity, and encourage others to contribute to a greener Bengaluru.\"'}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.h3,{id:\"join-the-green-movement\",children:\"Join the Green Movement\"}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Organised by:\"}),\" Swarna Bharat Foundation (Reg.) \\u2014 \",(0,e.jsx)(n.em,{children:\"Serving Humanity with Compassion Since 2012\"})]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"In collaboration with:\"}),\" Bruhat Bengaluru Mahanagara Palike (BBMP)\"]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsxs)(n.li,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(n.strong,{children:\"Founder & CEO:\"}),\" Dr. Rajini Santosh\"]}),`\n`,(0,e.jsx)(n.li,{children:(0,e.jsx)(n.em,{children:\"Together We Plant \\u2022 